az, M. L., 2004. Contribución al conocimiento de algunos moluscos 714 \nacuáticos (Mollusca: Gastropoda) en la cuenca del Ebro. Munibe, 55, 155-166. 715 \n 716 \nOscoz J., Galicia D., Miranda R., 2011. Identification Guide of Freshwater Macroinvertebrates 717 \nof Spain. Springer, Dordrecht, 173 pp. 718 \n 719 \nPaillex A., Dolédec S., Castella E. & Mérigoux S. (2009) Large river floodplain restoration: 720 \npredicting species richness and trait responses to the restoration of hydrological 721 \nconnectivity. Journal of Applied Ecology, 46, 250-258. 722 \n 723 \nPaisley, M. F., Trigg, D. J., & Walley, W. J., 2014. Revision of the biological monitoring working 724 \nparty (BMWP) score system: derivation of present‐only and abundance‐related scores from 725 \nfield data. River research and applications, 30, 887-904. 726 \n 727 \nPawlowski, J., Kelly-Quinn, M., Altermatt, F., Apothéloz-Perret-Gentil, L., Beja, P., Boggero, A., 728 \nBorja, A., Bouchez, A., Cordier, T., Domaizon, I., Feio, M.J., Filipe, A.F., Fornaroli , R., Graf, W., 729 \nHerder, J., van der Hoorn, B., Jones, J.I., Sagova-Mareckova, M., Moritz, C., Barquín, J. Piggott, 730 \nJ.J., Pinna, M., Rimet, F., Rinkevich, B., Sousa-Santos, C., Specchia, V., Trobajo, R., Vasselon, V., 731 \nVitecek, S., Zimmerman, J., Weigand, A ., Leese, F., Kahlert, M., 2018. The future of biotic 732 \nindices in the ecogenomic era: Integrating (e) DNA metabarcoding in biological assessment 733 \nof aquatic ecosystems. Science of the Total Environment, 637, 1295-1310 734 \n 735 \n28 \n \nReyjol, Y., Argillier, C., Bonne, W., Borja, A., Buijse, A.D., Cardoso, A.C., Daufresne, M., Kernan, 736 \nM., Ferreira, M.T., Poikane, S. , Prat, N., Solheim A.L., Stroffek, S. , Usseglio-Polatera, P., 737 \nVilleneuve, B., van de Bund, W., 2014. Assessing the ecological status in the cont ext of the 738 \nEuropean Water Framework Directive: where do we go now? Science of the Total 739 \nEnvironment, 497, 332-344. 740 \n 741 \nRosenberg DM,