  "quality": "C",
  "summary": "Species occupying high trophic positions with a small population size, limited diet and restricted range are vulnerable to extinction. The endangered Maugean skate (Zearaja maugeana) in Macquarie Harbour is potentially threatened by changin",
  "tags": [],
  "content_fetched": true,
  "pdf": null,
  "cid": "8ef52307b72e6147",
