y). Estuar. Coast. Shelf Sci. 60,\n133–149.\nWaldeback, M., Rydin, E., Markides, K., 1988.Use of accelerated solvent extraction for de-\ntermination of ecological important phosphorus in lake sediments. Int. J. Environ.\nAnal. Chem. 72 (4), 257 –266.\nWelker, C., Sdrigotti, E., Covelli, S., Faganeli, J., 2002.Microphytobenthos in the Gulf of Tri-\neste (Northern Adriatic Sea): relationship with labile sedimentary organic matter and\nnutrients. Estuar. Coast. Shelf Sci. 55, 259–273.\nWildish, D., Lassus, P., Martin, J., Saulnier, A., Bardouil, M., 1999. Effect of the PSP-causing\ndinoﬂagellate, Alexandrium sp. on the initial feeding response of Crassostrea gigas.\nAquat. Living Resour. 11 (1), 35 –43.\nZhang, L., Wang, L., Yin, K., Lü, Y., Zhang, D., Yang, Y., Huang, X., 2013. Pore water nutrient\ncharacteristics and the ﬂuxes across the sediment in the Pearl River estuary and ad-\njacent waters, China. Estuar. Coast. Shelf Sci. 133, 182–192.\n149E. Petranich et al. / Science of the Total Environment 644 (2018) 137–149\n13",
