n the Inability to Control Buoyancy in Deep Water\n \n \n Fisheries Management and Ecology \n \n https://doi.org/10.1111/fme.12780\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n &times; \n Add To My Library \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Create Research \n \n \n Close \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Archive \n \n \n \n \n Volume:\n 36\n Number:\n 2\n ,\n 15.06.2019\n \n \n \n \n \n \n Article Statistics \n \n \n Total Article Views \n \n \n \n \n Total Article Downloads \n \n \n \n \n Total Favorites \n \n \n \n \n Crossref\n Citation Count \n 3 \n \n \n \n Article Files \n \n \n \n \n \n Full Text\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Share \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Feedback \n \n \n \n \n &times;\n \n Please select the unit you would like to give feedback to. \n \n \n Send Feedback to the Journal\n \n \n \n \n Send Feedback to DergiPark",
