  "region": "国际",
  "quality": "C",
  "summary": "Abstract Fresh Submarine Groundwater Discharge (FSGD) has been increasingly recognized as a fresh water resource and potential path for pollutants to the ocean. Since directly measuring FSGD requires great effort and is currently only feasi",
  "tags": [],
  "content_fetched": true,
  "pdf": null,
  "cid": "f41bbd8863a1e6ef",
